@startuml Temporizacion
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFEFE

title Diagrama de Temporización - Entrega de Tarea

robust "Alumno" as A
robust "Frontend (JS)" as FE
robust "Google Classroom API" as GC
robust "servidor.js" as SRV

@0
A is Inactivo
FE is Esperando
GC is Disponible
SRV is Escuchando

@10
A is ClickConectar
FE is SolicitandoToken

@20
A is Esperando
FE is TokenObtenido
GC is ProcesandoCursos

@40
FE is RenderizandoCursos
GC is Disponible

@60
A is SeleccionaTarea
FE is CargandoSubmission
GC is ProcesandoSubmission

@80
FE is MostrandoModal
GC is Disponible

@100
A is IngresaEnlace
FE is Esperando

@120
A is ClickEntregar
FE is EnviandoPATCH
GC is ActualizandoSubmission
SRV is Escuchando

@140
FE is EnviandoTurnIn
GC is ProcesandoTurnIn

@160
FE is VerificandoEstado
GC is Disponible

@180
A is Inactivo
FE is MostrandoConfirmacion
GC is Disponible
SRV is Escuchando

@200
A is Inactivo
FE is Esperando

@enduml
